{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/410cc18316e42a5e577dec720acb8314.webp?t=1769881368\" width=600 height=57 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Atmospheric FPS-horror hybrid where human ambition meets primal terror.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/9afdf9d53a9d5cddad42264032e6398b.poster.avif?t=1769881368\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/9afdf9d53a9d5cddad42264032e6398b.webm?t=1769881368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/9afdf9d53a9d5cddad42264032e6398b.mp4?t=1769881368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person shooter with survival horror elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientific horror atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly graphics aesthetics reminiscent of late 90's games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding on the story established in '<i>Snowsquall Grip</i>', '<i>Re.Surs</i>', and '<i>Plastomorphosis</i>'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u200e\u200e  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/ddb60d0de8bb7984d653690d3973f577.poster.avif?t=1769881368\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/ddb60d0de8bb7984d653690d3973f577.webm?t=1769881368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/ddb60d0de8bb7984d653690d3973f577.mp4?t=1769881368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of Modern-City, the Continent's sprawling capital, an ominous discovery was made: dark energy particles accumulating at an unprecedented rate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Supreme One's Government immediately began construction of a classified laboratory complex within the imposing Nexus Tower. This colossal structure\u00a0dominates the skyline, serving as both a governmental headquarters and a research facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientists studying the mysterious concentration proposed the &quot;<strong>Synthesis</strong>&quot; experiment <strong>\u2013</strong> an ambitious attempt to isolate and manipulate a single dark particle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success would unlock the secrets of the Re.Surs, the unique dark energy that has permeated the entire Continent since the events documented in the &quot;Snowsquall Grip&quot; classified event.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now this catastrophic failure threatens the future of not only Modern-City, but all life on the Continent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the assistant researcher arriving late to your shift, you alone must contain the corruption that scientists couldn't control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/7c0324e02aad2cd3f931ff1dcb26f1c0.poster.avif?t=1769881368\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/7c0324e02aad2cd3f931ff1dcb26f1c0.webm?t=1769881368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629200/extras/7c0324e02aad2cd3f931ff1dcb26f1c0.mp4?t=1769881368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE GAME IS PART OF \u201cRE.SURS UNIVERSE\u201d GAME SERIES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SNOWSQUALL GRIP -&gt; SYNTHESIS OF CORRUPTION -&gt; RE.SURS -&gt; PLASTOMORPHOSIS</strong></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Running Late, Mr. Ace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629200/db5c9a095cce31f2856c5a7b7cf745b43cc8d9f0.jpg"},{"name":"Synthesis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629200/d5d0bba3e2e2e898e594fdc268d5adda733717b9.jpg"},{"name":"Axe Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629200/f2ae7d7c22ddebb440f293224f7aaf3a5a61eaf1.jpg"},{"name":"Office Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629200/28ce8c3c2de9014f08c15e58d81d3439398584f5.jpg"},{"name":"Born to Survive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629200/03e3182d7a0b1427d040b1da25e1b926a39a2571.jpg"},{"name":"Bureaucracy Hater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629200/7cdcbd62635274c929c61e10575e9e59df00d9f8.jpg"},{"name":"No Eyes, But Still Sees","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629200/e99e318e9670e1c4629cd817dfccd102392f8717.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Lose Your Head (Literally)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a